wh40k-quest-test-ambient-resident-line-1 = There is always another ship. I keep telling myself that.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-resident-line-2 = A warm meal and a dry bunk. That is my plan for today.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-resident-line-3 = The market feels different after a long voyage.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-resident-line-4 = Looking for proper work? Ask at the service counters.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-worker-line-1 = Sit down if you are dizzy. Pride can wait.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-worker-line-2 = Clean bandages first, stories afterwards.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-worker-line-3 = Tea is not a treatment. Still, it helps the night shift.
wh40k-quest-test-ambient-worker-line-4 = Sera handles intake. Please leave the corridor clear.
